Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,On this long journey that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,we've only barely begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendship, love, courage,\Nand a little bit of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That even as the years go by?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.46,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll not ever vanish from our minds!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.78,0:00:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We are all pieces of\Na single planet Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.98,0:00:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Little by little we can\Nfind each other's worth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.02,0:00:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we see what sort of\Nform we're meant to take!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:01:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us know the wind will\Nalways keep on blowing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As you finish what you've begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.52,0:01:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look through that wind to dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.58,0:01:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears as you're bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.26,0:01:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The things you must overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.18,0:01:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Found in meeting somebody new!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.72,0:01:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.94,0:01:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.86,0:01:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed will help\Nyou to become so much stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.94,0:01:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed\Nwill help you to remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything, everything, everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now and forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.76,0:01:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.66,0:01:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,As you finish what you've begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do that. Wind to dry all the tears!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.56,0:02:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're blaming the\Nthings you must overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.68,0:02:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Found in meeting somebody new!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.92,0:02:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.48,0:02:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be human!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.34,0:02:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.70,0:02:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody survives magellan's poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.08,0:02:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is straight up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.99,0:02:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Bonkers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.91,0:02:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just 20 hours then he\Nwalked out on his own!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.84,0:02:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.28,0:02:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to be miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's something far\Ngreater than just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.00,0:02:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.74,0:02:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.32,0:03:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.90,0:03:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat! It's Bon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.38,0:03:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad to see you're alive! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I died?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.24,0:03:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop taking my chain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.26,0:03:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who made me worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.66,0:03:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.20,0:03:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bond! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.44,0:03:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't die just now, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.68,0:03:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.88,0:03:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Bond boy is all worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.70,0:03:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Better to let him rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.26,0:03:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, what's up, Eva?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.60,0:03:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That did the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.72,0:03:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and thanks for helping out Bond, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.10,0:03:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.58,0:03:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not the one\Nyou should be thanking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bond boy worked hard for you. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I nudged you along\Nin the right direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And yes, my powers are\Ncertainly wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.02,0:03:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But this one's the hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.98,0:03:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Bon Boy stayed with you all night long,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.50,0:03:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,struggling and suffering for\Nhours and hours, never relenting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.34,0:03:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He lost his voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.76,0:03:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He could barely stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He even spewed blood,\Nbut he never stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He shouted, hang in there, and\Nyou have to live again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your recovery was far beyond miraculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.42,0:04:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only imagine that it's\Nthanks to all of his efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.36,0:04:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I see
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.86,0:04:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, is he naked?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.46,0:04:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawboy, I've come here to rescue you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of our everlasting friendship!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Juan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.92,0:04:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have your clothes, but I'm afraid\Nyou're not ready to up and leave just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:04:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It will take several days of rest and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.96,0:05:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,recuperation before you're\Nback to your old self.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.88,0:05:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.56,0:05:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already wasted too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to ask, but would you\Nmind looking after Bond for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back for him later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.30,0:05:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, you see like he said\Nyou've got some healing to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.28,0:05:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the paper still\Npointing down ace is close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.26,0:05:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.70,0:05:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.26,0:05:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Vivi card, I believe
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But to answer your question, you're\Non the floor between level 5 and 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume now you want to\Ngo rescue your brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.04,0:05:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,regardless of what\Nadvice we might give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's your life after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do whatever you want with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna make an escape too, Eva?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.66,0:05:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Before Bon and I got all messed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.72,0:05:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,he was planning on breaking\Nyour butt out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.16,0:05:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't talk about his butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are gonna leave, can you show\Nme where Ace is on your way out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.48,0:06:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Bond Boy sought out yours\Ntruly to help rescue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.68,0:06:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, how charming of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And a sweet gesture indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.84,0:06:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But alas, I have no need to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.84,0:06:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not my time to break out just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.08,0:06:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what's going on\Nin the world right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.98,0:06:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's been a shift in the\Ntide and big changes are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.24,0:06:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy and the Whitebeard\NPirates are taking center stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, the big man still\Nis waiting things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.86,0:06:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm of course referring to my comrade,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.74,0:06:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the leader of all\Nrevolutionaries in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You may know
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.98,0:06:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,him as Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.54,0:06:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're talking about my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.78,0:06:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.86,0:06:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,When your dad makes a move\Nwith that army of his,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.22,0:06:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,then I shall do some\Nmaneuvering of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:06:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Call it my grand comeback tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.16,0:07:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were to escape from this place now,\NI'd just end up on a sea of wanted lists.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.20,0:07:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dear papa and I never knew. Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.32,0:07:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.44,0:07:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon doesn't have any children.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.40,0:07:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just crazy talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.84,0:07:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I shouldn't have said anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.86,0:07:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.77,0:07:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa didn't keep it a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.02,0:07:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The name of your father\Nis Monkey D. Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.36,0:07:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The revolutionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really know that much about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never even seen\Nhis face before. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.94,0:07:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, this might be legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't come across as the\Nkind of person who would lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.38,0:08:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And he is a rather impressive\Npirate in his own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, the vitality he's shown\Nis the stuff of legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,An extraordinary father\Nand an extraordinary son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me, where\Ndid you come from? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.64,0:08:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He's blue
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.06,0:08:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sage dragon. When you step out for\Nair, you always seem to face in the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.72,0:08:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,same direction no matter where we go\Ndo i i suppose i never gave it much
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,thought bit strange that you would\Nbring it up isn't it well i wondered
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.52,0:08:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,if it was some sort of homing instinct\Nyou know the same thing animals have
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.04,0:08:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking of home, perhaps\Nsome family in the east
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.68,0:08:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe that's enough don't\Nstick your nose in my
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.24,0:08:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,past as you wish hang
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,on oh no if Straw Hat boy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,really is dragon's son\Nthis could be a disaster
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.86,0:09:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Inazuma, check to see when they're\Ntaking Ace boy away. Yes of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.28,0:09:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,course there isn't much time The\Nfever card was pointing down,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,which means he's still\Nhere and still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.44,0:09:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.50,0:09:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me that info as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.66,0:09:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading to level six\Nwith Straw Hat boy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.42,0:09:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're really gonna show me the way
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.28,0:09:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, you just said level six.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.72,0:09:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Ace was on five
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.88,0:09:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, you're already below level five
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.76,0:09:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.04,0:09:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.46,0:09:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I Straw Hat Boy is Dragon's son as\Nhe claims, then that means so is Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.68,0:09:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this why the Navy captured\Nhim and planned his execution?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.38,0:09:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's ludicrous,\Nnot to mention suicidal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way they'd pick a fight with\NWhitebeard Dragon at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.56,0:09:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What does the world government\Nhope to gain from all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.90,0:10:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, I have no\Nchoice but to make my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.94,0:10:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bon, rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back later, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.72,0:10:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.00,0:10:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to keep that a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.70,0:10:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not let people know\Nthat Dragon's your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I just figured that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.26,0:10:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm his dear friend, as well as\None of his trusted commanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.88,0:10:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I'm a revolutionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the reason I was arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's my duty to help you,\Nwhether you like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just stand around and let\Nmy friend's son die before my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.36,0:10:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell everyone in the\Nnewcomer land, we're going to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.48,0:10:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,move fast and rescue Ace\NBoy before his execution?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And then we'll break out of Impel Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Does everyone understand? Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.74,0:10:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so sudden!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.06,0:10:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A crossroad in life comes without warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're prepared to fight,\Nthen be prepared to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:11:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All right then, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.48,0:11:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.96,0:11:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming to save you, Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.86,0:11:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,His pulse is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.94,0:11:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.86,0:11:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Empire...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Energy hormone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.68,0:11:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a matter of adrenaline I just injected\Nyou with enough of it for a full day
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.72,0:11:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to let you know you're going\Nto feel the side effects several
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,days from now but by that Point\Nlet's hope it won't really matter
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.76,0:11:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr Two Mr Three and Buggy the Clown
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.68,0:11:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.59,0:11:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Two just waltzed them into the freezing\Nhell, and that was the last you saw of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.44,0:11:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.58,0:12:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,His disguise was perfect, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We searched for them, but all we could\Nfind was that head brisk covered in blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.08,0:12:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,From the lack of remains, we assumed\Nthat they took Straw Hat out of the cell,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.94,0:12:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but were eaten up by the wolves afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.80,0:12:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.84,0:12:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,sitting in the warden's chair, wearing\Nhis special order headpiece thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.22,0:12:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and yet I feel so empty. You know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I haven't earned it\Nuntil I've crushed Magellan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.58,0:12:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And let me remind you, if we\Nget tricked or beaten again,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.98,0:12:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,not only the warden's job, but\Nyour job will be on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.78,0:12:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My position, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.80,0:12:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're late, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're strict, Domino.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.70,0:12:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to empty your bowels faster next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.00,0:12:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.62,0:12:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again. You'll have to\Nhold it in if we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.38,0:12:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,make it in time we'll ruin\Nthe reputation of Impel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.00,0:12:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Down all
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.82,0:13:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,right listen
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.14,0:13:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,up our mission is to take
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.88,0:13:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Custody of Port. Custody\NAce and then transfer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.82,0:13:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,him to the Marine Board\NNavy Headquarters got it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.10,0:13:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,until the moment that we\Nhand over that prisoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.58,0:13:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I need each and every\None of you on full alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.90,0:13:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.38,0:13:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That we're ready for any possibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.58,0:13:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're moving him in a convoy of five ships
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.86,0:13:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,under the direction of five vice-admerals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.58,0:13:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot afford a single slip-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.70,0:13:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.44,0:13:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but I\Ngot a crap ton of energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.64,0:13:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.55,0:13:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to waste even a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no security here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.82,0:13:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So flex those leg muscles and\Nrun like crazy, Straw Hat boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.46,0:13:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:13:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are those weirdos?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.76,0:14:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ivankov? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.96,0:14:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.02,0:14:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.82,0:14:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.92,0:14:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No time for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.82,0:14:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Death?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wee!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.84,0:14:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Inazuma, open it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.48,0:14:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.02,0:14:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be monitoring us from\Nnow on. Who cares? Let them come!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We have intruders!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.82,0:14:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They're running down the staircase\Nbetween level five and six.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.32,0:14:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, the guy with the big head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's that queen of the queers\Nthat went missing years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.00,0:14:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Named Zivankov.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.46,0:14:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's he been hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.22,0:14:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We gave up on that guy ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:14:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The one running next to\Nhim is Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.78,0:15:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the warden took care of\Nhim, but he looks as healthy as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The third one is another missing prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.26,0:15:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Inazuma, a revolutionary\Nfrom the South Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.08,0:15:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.82,0:15:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're heading\Nstraight for level six.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.26,0:15:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they're trying\Nto save Firefist Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Domino and Warden\NMagellan are also on their
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,way to level six for the\Ntransfer as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all going to bump into each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How can they all still be alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Warden, when do you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.30,0:15:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate the passageway\Ntrapped immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.70,0:15:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Call all the jailers on level six.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them to get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll need to stand\Ntheir ground until Mistress
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadie and the Demon Guards\Narrive as reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.68,0:15:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Report everything that's going on\Nto all floors in Warden Magellan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.06,0:15:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You have your orders. Get\Nmoving, right? Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.16,0:15:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,i've never seen the vice\Nwarden so serious before?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.16,0:15:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's the imposter again we\Nhave to stop these troublemakers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.46,0:15:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Since i can't blame the\Nwarden for this one i mean
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.18,0:16:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We can make it we can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.56,0:16:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.08,0:16:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.70,0:16:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, Crocus D. Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.32,0:16:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to be\Ntransferred to Marineford.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.14,0:16:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon your arrival there, you will\Nbe taken to the execution grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.42,0:16:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The End
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.70,0:17:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy, Yvonne Conf, Queen of\Nthe Queers, and Inazuma the Revolutionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All three criminals are\Nnow entering level six.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.42,0:17:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.86,0:17:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.56,0:17:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.34,0:17:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.02,0:17:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.66,0:17:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.66,0:17:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you absolutely certain\Nthat this is the right cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.84,0:17:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.20,0:17:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He was just here, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.06,0:17:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a bit late. It seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.30,0:17:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.98,0:17:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.24,0:17:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.52,0:17:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She said that my brother is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:17:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She was telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.40,0:17:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought anyone could\Npenetrate this fortress,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.20,0:18:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,let alone make it all\Nthe way to level six.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.60,0:18:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Straw Hat, aren't you? Yeah.\NYou're a moment late. He was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.18,0:18:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They took him to the elevator\Nfor the prison transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.64,0:18:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.55,0:18:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still a chance you can catch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.12,0:18:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.08,0:18:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness. It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help, whoever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.54,0:18:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,To brave the impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.36,0:18:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To accomplish the inconceivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.60,0:18:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And to charge into yet another struggle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.22,0:18:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,More hopeless than the last!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.76,0:18:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They took that elevator\Nto the upper floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.78,0:18:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thankfully they've left the gate open.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.70,0:18:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.26,0:18:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems the operation system is locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.60,0:18:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't budge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:18:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.46,0:19:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.37,0:19:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to climb up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.94,0:19:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.98,0:19:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.40,0:19:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, that was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.94,0:19:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't let things be\Nconvenient for us now, can they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.38,0:19:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to find\Nourselves another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.06,0:19:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They're watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go back to the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.70,0:19:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, those jerks blocked the\Nstaircase. They're trying to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.42,0:19:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,trap us we'll just have to\Nbreak through then won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.58,0:19:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an awful lot of gas.\NDo you think it's deadly?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.06,0:19:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who the hell\Nyou punts are but if you're
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.98,0:19:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna get yourselves killed\Ndon't take us with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.18,0:19:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.32,0:19:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.70,0:19:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if it's poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.16,0:19:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.66,0:20:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.14,0:20:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.50,0:20:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleeping gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.41,0:20:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy didn't even give\Nit a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.22,0:20:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,At least try to stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.78,0:20:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.96,0:20:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.06,0:20:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the last thing we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.81,0:20:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They're hoping to stop us without a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How cowardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.40,0:20:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Warden, level six is\Nnow blocked off completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.20,0:20:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The sleeping gas is highly effective\Nand there's nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.02,0:20:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Just in case, keep the guards on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you report all this to Warden\NMagellan? Yes, sir. Just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.46,0:20:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.22,0:20:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I get to keep my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.62,0:20:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to place the blame for\Nthis entire fiasco on Magellan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.18,0:20:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll become the warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.94,0:20:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, the microphone's still on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.82,0:20:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.76,0:20:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.40,0:20:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat made it to level\Nsix just after we left.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.60,0:20:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunate timing for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.58,0:20:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.98,0:21:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't in the mood for a nap,\Nbut it seems we're out of options.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.80,0:21:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.98,0:21:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The emergency sleeping\Ngas has flooded level 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.72,0:21:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nbefore they catch Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.52,0:21:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently the freezing hell\Nwasn't punishment enough for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.80,0:21:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the cell you are in now\Nas a vacancy Straw Hat will have
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.92,0:21:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,a taste of the torment reserved\Nfor our most heinous criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.72,0:21:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, no one told you\Nto stop, keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.08,0:22:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you, resistance is futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.98,0:22:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.14,0:22:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother's a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.98,0:22:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,His fate was sealed the moment\Nhe stepped in this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.76,0:22:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.38,0:22:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd hoped Hancock was lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.06,0:22:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But this troubles me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.96,0:22:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how strong he is, he\Nshouldn't have recovered from my poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.76,0:22:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.10,0:22:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you do it, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.08,0:22:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.74,0:22:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.26,0:22:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole floor is filling with gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.20,0:22:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.14,0:23:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's cutting a stone floor\Nlike it's made of paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.44,0:23:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.35,0:23:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's flipping it up like a ribbon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.26,0:23:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's one way to deal\Nwith the problem, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.04,0:23:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it, but I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.14,0:23:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Inazuma ate the snip-snip fruit,\Nso now he's a scissor man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.30,0:23:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He can manipulate whatever he\Ncuts as though it's made of paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.34,0:23:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.25,0:23:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.46,0:23:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fall asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.12,0:23:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If you doze off on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.20,0:23:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I might get drowsy. But I never sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.74,0:23:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop doing that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.52,0:23:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.74,0:23:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta keep going up, crab guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.92,0:23:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for blocking out the gas, but now\NI can't go up the stairs to get to Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.68,0:24:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only way to prevent the\Nsleeping gas from filling up the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.82,0:24:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're unconscious, you\Ncan't save anybody, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.74,0:24:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save him whether\NI'm unconscious or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.16,0:24:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let him die, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.34,0:24:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.76,0:24:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a simple plan, but\Nit defeated us nonetheless.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.84,0:24:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,As much as I hate to admit it,\Nwe're trapped here on Level 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.80,0:24:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,at least for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.86,0:24:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.04,0:24:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is all I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.18,0:24:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,At least the jerks can't watch us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.56,0:24:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we gave it a good shot,\Nbut no time for regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.62,0:24:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that by now\Nthey've made their way to
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.84,0:24:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,the top floor to hand\Noff Ace for the transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.36,0:24:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we could get out, we'd have quite\Nthe melange of obstacles in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.66,0:24:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy's convoy is quick, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.22,0:24:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at the Viva card.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.98,0:24:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not pointing straight\Nup anymore, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.46,0:24:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That means that Ace has already\Nbeen handed over to the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.76,0:25:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's time to start\Nthinking of ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.74,0:25:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The first step is your escape, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.26,0:25:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I will do my very best to break\Nyou out of this prison safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.42,0:25:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,As far as Ace Boy in the Navy goes,\Nthat ship has already sailed, literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.38,0:25:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up on him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.20,0:25:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather, put your faith in Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.44,0:25:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he'd give\Nup on one of his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.62,0:25:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll come up with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.84,0:25:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.36,0:25:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to Marineford.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.68,0:25:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.40,0:25:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A massive battle is about\Nto take place between
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.50,0:25:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,two of the most powerful\Nforces in the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.62,0:25:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how\Nstrong Whitebeard is?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.54,0:25:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What about all the admirals, vice-admirals,\Nand the warlords on the Navy side?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.72,0:25:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember them?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.98,0:25:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And are you also forgetting how close to
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.06,0:25:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,death you were after\Nthe fight with Magellan?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.96,0:25:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have that many lives to spare?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.22,0:26:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.48,0:26:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, if I give up now, I'll regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.26,0:26:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that face I've\Nseen it many times before
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.20,0:26:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,it's the face of his father staring at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.82,0:26:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Unflinching you can do\Nas you like but first
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.08,0:26:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,of all how do you propose\Nwe get off this floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.64,0:26:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want out, that bat\Nthen set me free, I'll.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.70,0:26:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,make a hole in the ceiling\Nand you'll be free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.42,0:26:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sound good. No way they've\Ngot him down here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.34,0:26:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,just like
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.96,0:26:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,old times huh
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.16,0:26:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you know for the life of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.22,0:26:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't think of a good reason to break\Nout of here but whitebeard and the navy
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.64,0:26:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,are gonna Start a war this is my chance to\Nbring down that old man once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.44,0:27:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This clash of powers\Nhas piqued my interest,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.38,0:27:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've just the tools in my disposal\Nto get us a front row seat to the action.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.74,0:27:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You scratch my back\Nand I'll scratch yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.42,0:27:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a bad proposition, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.86,0:27:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw that crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.24,0:27:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You messed up Phoebe's\Nwhole country, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.38,0:27:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You can rock down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.29,0:27:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.42,0:27:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That place is no longer\Nof any interest to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.66,0:27:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,however you may feel we still need\Nhis help if we have an opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.80,0:27:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,to escape from here then we're\Nobliged to take it what are you crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.96,0:27:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,eva do you know what this guy is no\Ntime to be hoity-toity sandy pants
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.98,0:27:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,here is our only ticket outside hello\Nifon cough my my it's been a long
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.32,0:27:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,time a Krieg boy hey wait you two\Nknow each other just a passing
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.00,0:28:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,acquaintance i met him when he was a\Nrookie all wet behind the ears i wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.34,0:28:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,worry if this guy tries to double\Ncross us i'll whip him into shape in
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.18,0:28:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,a jiffy as long as i've got an eye on\Nhim then he should behave just fine
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.96,0:28:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,he is a scoundrel but\Nhe's a scoundrel with
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.78,0:28:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,a weakness i know well\Nhey if you so much as
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.58,0:28:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,mention a word you can\Nshut that mouth of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.48,0:28:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,help us out and keep\Nyour dirty little secret
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.82,0:28:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.52,0:28:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cocky bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.74,0:28:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, while you're at it,\Nyou should let me out of here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.84,0:28:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, too, me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.12,0:28:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a boat to pick with whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.98,0:28:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let me out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.02,0:28:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.56,0:28:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Death wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.42,0:28:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, have mercy on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.92,0:28:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you to take me with you. I will\Nbe of great service. I've known your
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.92,0:28:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,brother ace since he first joined\Nthe white beard pirates he's a good
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.32,0:29:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,friend and i know you too from all\Nthe stories he's told i'm not like
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.84,0:29:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the others down here i was arrested\Nbecause i objected to his execution
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.06,0:29:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to help save Ace too. I\Nswear I will put my life on the line
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.02,0:29:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,For him, hmm. Jean Bay, the first son\Nof the sea. If they imprisoned him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.92,0:29:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,here Then he must have relinquished\Nhis title As one of the seven
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.72,0:29:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,warlords That would mean his self-proclaimed\Nbond with Ace Has merit indeed
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.46,0:29:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then Wait, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.06,0:29:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never even met this man,\Nand he's most assuredly dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.46,0:29:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.46,0:29:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let him out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.80,0:29:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my gratitude. Me next!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.26,0:29:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I like Ace too!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.36,0:29:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll die for him and stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.02,0:29:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You boys are asking for a death!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.76,0:30:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Two warlords or two former\Nwarlords that is… wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.12,0:30:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,this guy for real you won't\Nregret this i will fight to
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.16,0:30:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,protect ace even if it means\Nmy own end if you think you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.98,0:30:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,can stop the war between the\Nnavy and whitebeard go ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.74,0:30:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and try i don't give a damn\Neither way as long as i get
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.76,0:30:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,a shot at that crusty old\Nbastard it's worth it for me if
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.86,0:30:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll let you lay a\Nsingle finger on Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.38,0:30:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you're wrong well then why\Ndon't you just try and stop me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.90,0:30:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Krieg boy your secret past remember
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.86,0:30:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,it's settled then let's get moving\Nwe don't have much time with
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.06,0:30:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A team this formidable, not even\NImpel Down can hold us. Hee-haw!
